      "content": "but rest feels like just more time passing. i'm just waiting for a sunset that never comes. it's like i've completed the game, you know? i've seen all the levels, i've reached the end credits. there's nothing left to unlock. i'm just sitting here in the dark, and part of me thinks it would be so much more peaceful to just... stop. to just let the credits roll for real.",
